    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Step 4:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Compare your findings with the pickup photos to ensure that the vehicle has been delivered in the same condition as when it was picked up.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>After the visual inspection, proceed to verify the vehicle's odometer readings against the details provided in the LR (Loading and Unloading) Bill of Lading.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Step 1:</strong> Locate the odometer reading on the LR Bill of Lading.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Step 2:</strong> Measure the actual odometer reading of the delivered vehicle.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Step 3:</strong> Compare the recorded odometer reading on the LR Bill of Lading with the actual reading measured.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Step 4:</strong> If there is a discrepancy between the recorded and measured odometer readings, notify the recipient immediately and discuss the resolution.</span></li>
	</ul>

	<p>To ensure a smooth handover process, it is essential to obtain a signed condition sign-off from the recipient or authorized representative.</p></div>
